{"id":"n20807-1-7","stage":5,"title":"열광 · 狂热","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20807-1-7-1","ko":"너 어제 콘서트에 다녀왔다며? 어땠어?","zh":"你昨天去参加演唱会了是吧？感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"콘서트에","meaning":"演唱会","explanation":"콘서트：演唱会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"콘서트","audio":"/audio/44a0e1f45e2b9fb0331d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28165","senseId":"1","lemma":"콘서트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콘서트에","audio":"/audio/54ec765be54c4ee7e9bf.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔다며?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔다며","audio":"/audio/e52756889394982a87f9.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"44a0e1f45e2b9fb0","term":"콘서트","zh":"演唱会","audio":"/audio/44a0e1f45e2b9fb0331d.mp3","entryId":"28165","definition":"面向观众演奏乐器或唱歌的表演。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4536f2946b96e08c8d7b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20807-1-7-2","ko":"응, 내가 좋아하는 가수 콘서트였는데, 정말 열광의 도가니였어.","zh":"嗯，是我喜欢的歌手的演唱会，简直就是一片狂热的氛围啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하는","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하는","audio":"/audio/2b4807c27825ce3100ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가수","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}},{"text":"콘서트였는데,","meaning":"演唱会","explanation":"콘서트：演唱会；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"콘서트","audio":"/audio/44a0e1f45e2b9fb0331d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28165","senseId":"1","lemma":"콘서트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콘서트였는데","audio":"/audio/d335d158c65083b45013.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"열광의","meaning":"狂热，疯狂，","explanation":"열광：狂热，疯狂，；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"열광","audio":"/audio/f36a5a6fad51735148b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20807","senseId":"1","lemma":"열광","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열광의","audio":"/audio/45553f5d75fd0690a5e1.mp3"}},{"text":"도가니였어.","meaning":"沸腾，高涨，深渊","explanation":"도가니：沸腾，高涨，深渊；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"도가니","audio":"/audio/0ecbb4a3c4aad869f2dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47506","senseId":"2","lemma":"도가니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도가니였어","audio":"/audio/8d51ea37cf346c4b8964.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"44a0e1f45e2b9fb0","term":"콘서트","zh":"演唱会","audio":"/audio/44a0e1f45e2b9fb0331d.mp3","entryId":"28165","definition":"面向观众演奏乐器或唱歌的表演。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f36a5a6fad517351","term":"열광","zh":"狂热，疯狂，","audio":"/audio/f36a5a6fad51735148b2.mp3","entryId":"20807","definition":"过于高兴或兴奋，像疯了似的蹦跳；或指那样的状态。","pronunciation":["열광"]},{"id":"0ecbb4a3c4aad869","term":"도가니","zh":"沸腾，高涨，深渊","audio":"/audio/0ecbb4a3c4aad869f2dc.mp3","entryId":"47506","definition":"(喻义)众人的情绪处于极度亢奋、紧张的状态。","pronunciation":["도가니"]}],"audio":"/audio/abd1c46480359b7a9215.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.222,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=20807","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你昨天去参加演唱会了是吧？感觉怎么样？","嗯，是我喜欢的歌手的演唱会，简直就是一片狂热的氛围啊。","那个朋友的回答真是模棱两可啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你昨天去参加演唱会了是吧？感觉怎么样？","嗯，是我喜欢的歌手的演唱会，简直就是一片狂热的氛围啊。","那个朋友的回答真是模棱两可啊。"],"answer":1}]}
